      <description>&lt;h3&gt;Settings moves out of the way&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Mac&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Settings opens from the gear at the end of the sync line in the sidebar. Press ⌘, or choose Verbose › Settings to open it from anywhere.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Also on iPhone&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Settings opens from the round button beside the date on Home, and no longer takes a tab.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/stumpandroot/verbose-updates/releases/tag/beta-254"&gt;Release notes on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
